  "as_of": "2022-09-08",
  "sentences": [
   "The bill would apply the labour mobility program tax imposition framework to eligible earnings of foreign resident workers participating in the Pacific Australia Labour Mobility scheme.",
   "A final tax rate of 15 per cent would cover qualifying employment payments, with the tax changes intended to apply from 1 July 2022.",
   "It would accompany Treasury amendments setting eligibility and withholding arrangements, while workers who qualify as Australian tax residents would remain subject to ordinary resident rates."
  ],
  "changes": [
   "The existing seasonal labour tax approach would extend to the consolidated Pacific labour mobility scheme.",
   "The imposition provision would specify a 15 per cent rate for amounts covered by the tax.",
   "Commencement would be set retrospectively at 1 July 2022."
  ],
  "affected": "Eligible foreign resident workers in the covered labour mobility schemes would be affected.",
